# | own_c2 | **R3.audit gate**: own bank on C2 ∪ C2_hard (600; structures banned from own-FPNet training), library ban = val_key ban_rows + ban_keys, sv = 0. PASS iff MRR@25 gain ≥ +0.02 and truth up > down |
# | full1_c2 | same rows for fpnet_full1 — reported only (it trained on every fold) |
# | own_c1 / full1_c1 | C1_npx (slice I, 245) — leaked upper bound, reported only |
